Rule 1 (Image tensor must have at least three dimensions)
{image : tensor} |= ndim(image) ≥ 3
>>
Rule 2 (Image tensor must have either 3 or 4 dimensions)
{image : tensor} |= (ndim(image) = 3) ∨ (ndim(image) = 4)
>>
Rule 93 (Shape is valid if dimension is valid)
{image : tensor} |= if ndim(image) = 3 then true else if ndim(image) = 4 then true
